<Base title="Privacy Policy | HomeBackupCost" description="HomeBackupCost's privacy policy: the calculator runs in your browser, and we don't sell personal data.">
<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="src">Draft, effective date to be set at launch.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>The calculator runs entirely in your browser.</strong> Your appliance choices and state are not sent to us.</li>
<li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> the signup form is a placeholder and collects nothing. When it goes live, we'll name the email provider here, use your email only to send the newsletter, and include an unsubscribe link in every email.</li>
<li><strong>Analytics:</strong> none is installed right now. If we add privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics later, we'll list it here.</li>
<li><strong>Affiliate links:</strong> retailers you visit through our links may set their own cookies under their own privacy policies.</li>
<li>We do not sell personal information.</li>
</ul>
</Base>
